 6412:       '\nline 1\nline 2\nline 3\nline 4\nline 5\nline 6',
 6413:     );
 6414:     // Growing content produces the caret-into-view scroll only after the
 6415:     // affected blocks' measured heights land: the mutation frame still carries
 6416:     // the pre-edit (short) heights, so the scroll re-arms on the frame where
 6417:     // the real extents are recorded. Two pumps advance past that post-frame
 6418:     // measurement and the subsequent re-layout.
 6419:     await tester.pump();
 6420:     await tester.pump();
 6421: 
 6422:     expect(_scrollOffset(tester), greaterThan(scrollBefore));
 6423:     tester.testTextInput.log.clear();
 6424: 
 6425:     await tester.pump();
 6426: 
